{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "98bcb946-4bb3-83ba-835b-f20c8cd396c8",
  "created_at": "2026-02-13T15:31:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:28:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. I am calling for the table, for a reservation. Tonight, for four persons. This is the, uh, the restaurant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, I'm sorry, this is the City Clerk's office at Newport City Hall. Which restaurant were you trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall? No, no. [pause] I wanted the Italian place, on Thames. I have the number in my head, and I dial, and I get you. Sorry, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, it happens. I can't look up the number for you from here, but if you tell me the name, I'd say a quick search on your phone will get you the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So you are not the restaurant, and you do not do the reservations. I understand correctly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. We do records, licenses, council paperwork, that kind of thing. No tables, unfortunately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[laughs] No tables. Okay. You know, I just finish a double shift, sixteen hours almost, and my head is, how do you say, a little bit floating. I dial one number wrong and I think, why the lady is speaking about City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixteen hours, wow. No wonder. Go get yourself some dinner, you earned it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, that is the plan. But the number, it is, I think I put the last numbers in the wrong order. So if I call again, I should put them the other way around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say which digits are off, I don't have the restaurant's number in front of me. Best bet is to search the name and tap the number it shows you, so you don't have to dial it by hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:30:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tap the number. Okay. On the screen, I press, and it calls. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:31:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Search the name, press the number, and it dials for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:31:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Good. I am sorry again to bother you, Friday afternoon, you are busy, and I am here asking for the pasta."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're not bothering me. Hope the pasta is worth it. Have a good evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-13T15:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you. You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
